><td class=\"cl-00011b28\"><p class=\"cl-0000d604\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">53 (27%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-00011b5a\"><p class=\"cl-0000d5fb\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">Regional</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-00011b5b\"><p class=\"cl-0000d604\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\"></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-00011b1f\"><p class=\"cl-0000d605\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">Non Jawa-Bali</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-00011b28\"><p class=\"cl-0000d604\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">120 (61%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-00011b5c\"><p class=\"cl-0000d605\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">Jawa-Bali</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-00011b64\"><p class=\"cl-0000d604\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">78 (39%)</span></p></td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td  colspan=\"2\"class=\"cl-00011b65\"><p class=\"cl-0000d60e\"><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd6\">1</span><span class=\"cl-fffbdbd7\">Mean (SD); n (%)</span></p></td></tr></tfoot></table></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
